      "alt": "MBa8MP-RAS314 Single Board Computer",
      "text": "<h1>Powerful, Versatile and Robust Pi Alternative to Blaze a Path from Prototypes to Long-Term Production.</h1>\n<p>Raspberry Pi fans have needed a path from prototype designs to production, and TQ has brought the solution. Enter the new MBa8MP-RAS314.&nbsp; TQ, known for robust, long-term embedded solutions, has crafted this platform to enhance the following: Processing (NPU) for Machine Learning acceleration, Ethernet (2 ports &amp; TSN), Flash (NOR &amp; eMMC), LVDS for displays, Bluetooth (5.2), USB 3.0 (4x ports + device port), Security functions, OS options (Yocto Linux, Armbian and Android-upon request), Extended temp and Long life availability.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 17:53:42 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
      "altValueFromDAM": "false",
      "cq:styleIds": [
       "1718154328384"
      ],
